INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('orotheim', 'Orotheim is a small cave located northeast of Rorikstead and southeast of Robber''s Gorge in Hjaalmarch. The cave serves as a hideout for bandits who are intent on poaching mammoths.

A rough path runs northwest from the River Hjaal, winding around the mountain to the cave entrance. Adventurers should beware of the numerous bear traps scattered along the approach. ', '''adventur'':50B ''along'':59B ''approach'':61B ''around'':43B ''bandit'':26B ''bear'':56B ''bewar'':52B ''cave'':6B,20B,48B ''entranc'':49B ''gorg'':16B ''hideout'':24B ''hjaal'':41B ''hjaalmarch'':18B ''intent'':29B ''locat'':7B ''mammoth'':32B ''mountain'':45B ''northeast'':8B ''northwest'':37B ''numer'':55B ''orotheim'':1A,2B ''path'':35B ''poach'':31B ''river'':40B ''robber'':14B ''rorikstead'':10B ''rough'':34B ''run'':36B ''scatter'':58B ''serv'':21B ''small'':5B ''southeast'':12B ''trap'':57B ''wind'':42B', 'hjaalmarch', 'Orotheim is a small cave located northeast of Rorikstead in Hjaalmarch. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fortify_smithing', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Restoration abilities that enhance the caster;s proficiency in crafting and improving weapons and armor, resulting in superior-quality gear. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted gear, making it invaluable for blacksmiths. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Fortify Smithing effect: Blisterwort, Glowing Mushroom, Pearlfish, Sabre Cat Tooth, Spriggan Sap', '''abil'':11B ''also'':48B ''appli'':50B ''armor'':24B ''avail'':34B ''blacksmith'':58B ''blisterwort'':82B ''brew'':42B ''caster'':15B ''cat'':87B ''combin'':60B ''craft'':19B,38B ''creat'':74B ''custom'':44B ''effect'':5B,32B,72B,81B ''enchant'':52B ''enhanc'':13B ''focus'':9B ''follow'':66B ''fortifi'':1A,79B ''gear'':30B,53B ''general'':59B ''glow'':83B ''improv'':21B ''ingredi'':67B ''invalu'':56B ''least'':62B ''magic'':4B ''make'':54B ''mushroom'':84B ''pearlfish'':85B ''potion'':39B,45B,76B ''pre'':37B ''pre-craft'':36B ''profici'':17B ''provid'':68B ''qualiti'':29B ''restor'':10B ''result'':25B ''sabr'':86B ''sap'':90B ''share'':70B ''smith'':2A,80B ''spriggan'':89B ''superior'':28B ''superior-qu'':27B ''tooth'':88B ''two'':63B ''util'':8B ''utility-focus'':7B ''weapon'':22B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This enchantment makes crafting and upgrading weapons and armor more effective. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
