INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('daughter_of_the_niben', 'Bravil: Daughter of the Niben, written by Sathyr Longleat, offers a historical and cultural exploration of the city of Bravil in Cyrodiil, focusing on its fascinating past and the legendary statue of the Lucky Old Lady. The book delves into Bravil''s Ayleid origins, where the city was once heavily populated by these ancient elves, and highlights the dramatic siege of the town during the Alessian Empire''s expansion. The famed story of the city''s founder, Teo Bravillius Tasus, is recounted, showcasing his strategic victories against the elusive Ayleids, who had mastered magical techniques such as levitation and underwater breathing to evade capture. Despite their eventual defeat, the legacy of the Ayleids is woven into the city''s fabric, with few remnants visible today.

The book also touches on the legend of the Lucky Old Lady, a local figure whose kindness led her to be blessed with fortune after helping a cursed Imperial prince. The statue of the Lucky Old Lady has stood as a symbol of Bravil''s luck and charm, attracting those seeking blessings from her. The themes of luck, generosity, and the blending of past and present highlight Bravil''s unique identity as a city steeped in both history and folklore. This book serves as a single volume that encapsulates the rich narrative of Bravil, offering readers a glimpse into both its storied past and its vibrant present.', '''alessian'':70B ''also'':132B ''ancient'':58B ''attract'':178B ''ayleid'':47B,94B,117B ''blend'':191B ''bless'':151B,181B ''book'':42B,131B,211B ''bravil'':5B,24B,45B,173B,197B,223B ''bravillius'':83B ''breath'':105B ''captur'':108B ''charm'':177B ''citi'':22B,51B,79B,122B,203B ''cultur'':18B ''curs'':157B ''cyrodiil'':26B ''daughter'':1A,6B ''defeat'':112B ''delv'':43B ''despit'':109B ''dramat'':63B ''elus'':93B ''elv'':59B ''empir'':71B ''encapsul'':218B ''evad'':107B ''eventu'':111B ''expans'':73B ''explor'':19B ''fabric'':124B ''fame'':75B ''fascin'':30B ''figur'':144B ''focus'':27B ''folklor'':209B ''fortun'':153B ''founder'':81B ''generos'':188B ''glimps'':227B ''heavili'':54B ''help'':155B ''highlight'':61B,196B ''histor'':16B ''histori'':207B ''ident'':200B ''imperi'':158B ''kind'':146B ''ladi'':40B,141B,166B ''led'':147B ''legaci'':114B ''legend'':136B ''legendari'':34B ''levit'':102B ''local'':143B ''longleat'':13B ''luck'':175B,187B ''lucki'':38B,139B,164B ''magic'':98B ''master'':97B ''narrat'':221B ''niben'':4A,9B ''offer'':14B,224B ''old'':39B,140B,165B ''origin'':48B ''past'':31B,193B,232B ''popul'':55B ''present'':195B,236B ''princ'':159B ''reader'':225B ''recount'':86B ''remnant'':127B ''rich'':220B ''sathyr'':12B ''seek'':180B ''serv'':212B ''showcas'':87B ''sieg'':64B ''singl'':215B ''statu'':35B,161B ''steep'':204B ''stood'':168B ''stori'':76B,2