INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('orsinium_and_the_orcs', 'How Orsinium Passed to the Orcs, written by Menyna Gsost, tells the story of Gortwog gro-Nagorm''s quest to claim the land of Orsinium in 3E 399, set in a legal dispute against the Breton noble, Lord Bowyn. The land was contested, and the final resolution was to be decided by a duel between Gortwog and Bowyn, adhering to ancient laws of property rights. The duel, however, was far from ordinary, as it required both combatants to wear Orcish armor, which was unfamiliar and unwieldy to the Breton lord. As Bowyn struggled with the armor and the training needed to fight in it, the situation became more tense, especially when the duel was moved forward by Gortwog''s request.

Through intense training and manipulation by his cousin, Lord Berylith, Bowyn faced the battle under less-than-ideal conditions, including a lavish feast that left him sluggish. In the end, Gortwog emerged victorious, claiming the land as Orsinium in honor of his heritage. The narrative highlights themes of honor, pride, and the complexities of legal and physical combat. It also touches on the subtleties of cultural differences, as the Orcs, led by Gortwog, prove their worth through a display of mastery over the land that had been historically contested.', '''399'':33B ''3e'':32B ''adher'':64B ''also'':186B ''ancient'':66B ''armor'':86B,101B ''battl'':139B ''becam'':112B ''berylith'':135B ''bowyn'':44B,63B,97B,136B ''breton'':41B,94B ''claim'':26B,160B ''combat'':82B,184B ''complex'':179B ''condit'':145B ''contest'':48B,215B ''cousin'':133B ''cultur'':192B ''decid'':56B ''differ'':193B ''display'':205B ''disput'':38B ''duel'':59B,72B,118B ''emerg'':158B ''end'':156B ''especi'':115B ''face'':137B ''far'':75B ''feast'':149B ''fight'':107B ''final'':51B ''forward'':121B ''gortwog'':19B,61B,123B,157B,199B ''gro'':21B ''gro-nagorm'':20B ''gsost'':14B ''heritag'':169B ''highlight'':172B ''histor'':214B ''honor'':166B,175B ''howev'':73B ''ideal'':144B ''includ'':146B ''intens'':127B ''land'':28B,46B,162B,210B ''lavish'':148B ''law'':67B ''led'':197B ''left'':151B ''legal'':37B,181B ''less'':142B ''less-than-id'':141B ''lord'':43B,95B,134B ''manipul'':130B ''masteri'':207B ''menyna'':13B ''move'':120B ''nagorm'':22B ''narrat'':171B ''need'':105B ''nobl'':42B ''orc'':4A,10B,196B ''orcish'':85B ''ordinari'':77B ''orsinium'':1A,6B,30B,164B ''pass'':7B ''physic'':183B ''pride'':176B ''properti'':69B ''prove'':200B ''quest'':24B ''request'':125B ''requir'':80B ''resolut'':52B ''right'':70B ''set'':34B ''situat'':111B ''sluggish'':153B ''stori'':17B ''struggl'':98B ''subtleti'':190B ''tell'':15B ''tens'':114B ''theme'':173B ''touch'':187B ''train'':104B,128B ''unfamiliar'':89B ''