INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_poison_song', '
The Poison Song, written by Bristin Xel, is an epic, historically inaccurate tale set in the aftermath of the War with the Dwemer and House Dagoth. The story follows Tay, a young boy raised in House Indoril after the War, who is haunted by a mysterious "Song" and the secrets of his true origins. As the narrative unfolds, Tay discovers he is the heir to the long-destroyed House Dagoth, and the Song leads him on a dark path of violence and tragedy. The book explores themes of identity, destiny, and the destructive power of inherited legacies, as Tay is consumed by the Song''s influence, which drives him to murder and betrayal. His journey takes him through a series of devastating choices, culminating in a tragic and violent end.

The book is divided into seven volumes, each chronicling a significant phase of Tay''s life as he grapples with the Song and his role as the heir of House Dagoth. Throughout the story, Tay''s relationships with those around him, including his cousin Baynarah, are strained as the Song pulls him deeper into the conflict of his heritage. Ultimately, the tale highlights the cyclical nature of violence and the difficulty of escaping one''s fate. The narrative''s intricate interplay of familial ties, political intrigue, and the supernatural makes it a tragic exploration of the consequences of the past on future generations.', '''aftermath'':20B ''around'':174B ''baynarah'':179B ''betray'':117B ''book'':89B,136B ''boy'':36B ''bristin'':9B ''choic'':127B ''chronicl'':143B ''conflict'':190B ''consequ'':231B ''consum'':105B ''cousin'':178B ''culmin'':128B ''cyclic'':199B ''dagoth'':29B,74B,165B ''dark'':82B ''deeper'':187B ''destini'':94B ''destroy'':72B ''destruct'':97B ''devast'':126B ''difficulti'':205B ''discov'':63B ''divid'':138B ''drive'':112B ''dwemer'':26B ''end'':134B ''epic'':13B ''escap'':207B ''explor'':90B,228B ''famili'':217B ''fate'':210B ''follow'':32B ''futur'':236B ''generat'':237B ''grappl'':153B ''haunt'':46B ''heir'':67B,162B ''heritag'':193B ''highlight'':197B ''histor'':14B ''hous'':28B,39B,73B,164B ''ident'':93B ''inaccur'':15B ''includ'':176B ''indoril'':40B ''influenc'':110B ''inherit'':100B ''interplay'':215B ''intric'':214B ''intrigu'':220B ''journey'':119B ''lead'':78B ''legaci'':101B ''life'':150B ''long'':71B ''long-destroy'':70B ''make'':224B ''murder'':115B ''mysteri'':49B ''narrat'':60B,212B ''natur'':200B ''one'':208B ''origin'':57B ''past'':234B ''path'':83B ''phase'':146B ''poison'':2A,5B ''polit'':219B ''power'':98B ''pull'':185B ''rais'':37B ''relationship'':171B ''role'':159B ''secret'':53B ''seri'':124B ''set'':17B ''seven'':140B ''signific'':145B ''song'':3A,6B,50B,77B,108B,156B,184B ''stori'':31B,168B ''strain'':181B ''supernatur'':