INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('chillrend', '
Chillrend is a unique glass shortsword of unknown origin, distinguished by its blue hue instead of the typical green of malachite. Crafted with rare metals and moonstone, it is enchanted to inflict frost damage and may also weaken opponents to frost or cause temporary paralysis. Notably, Chillrend can repair itself when its wielder takes frost damage, making it a formidable and enduring weapon.', '''also'':38B ''blue'':14B ''caus'':44B ''chillrend'':1A,2B,48B ''craft'':23B ''damag'':35B,57B ''distinguish'':11B ''enchant'':31B ''endur'':63B ''formid'':61B ''frost'':34B,42B,56B ''glass'':6B ''green'':20B ''hue'':15B ''inflict'':33B ''instead'':16B ''make'':58B ''malachit'':22B ''may'':37B ''metal'':26B ''moonston'':28B ''notabl'':47B ''oppon'':40B ''origin'':10B ''paralysi'':46B ''rare'':25B ''repair'':50B ''shortsword'':7B ''take'':55B ''temporari'':45B ''typic'':19B ''uniqu'':5B ''unknown'':9B ''weaken'':39B ''weapon'':64B ''wielder'':54B', 'scholar, thievesguild', 'Chillrend is a unique blue glass shortsword crafted with rare materials, enchanted to inflict frost damage, weaken enemies, and cause paralysis. It can repair itself when its wielder takes frost damage, making it both powerful and enduring.', '', '', 'artifacts');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('briar_heart', 'Briar Hearts are powerful ingredients that look like a cluster of red and green spiked leavesas a heart for Forsworn Briarhearts, known for their potent magical properties. Alchemy effects: Restore Magicka, Fortify Block, Paralysis, and Fortify Magicka.', '''alchemi'':30B ''block'':35B ''briar'':1A,3B ''briarheart'':23B ''cluster'':12B ''effect'':31B ''forsworn'':22B ''fortifi'':34B,38B ''green'':16B ''heart'':2A,4B,20B ''ingredi'':7B ''known'':24B ''leavesa'':18B ''like'':10B ''look'':9B ''magic'':28B ''magicka'':33B,39B ''paralysi'':36B ''potent'':27B ''power'':6B ''properti'':29B ''red'':14B ''restor'':32B ''spike'':17B', 'alchemist', 'Briar Hearts are powerful ingredients that look like a cluster of red and green spiked leavesas a heart for Forsworn Briarhearts, known for their potent magical properties.  
You do not know the alchemical effects of this ingredient. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('frostmere_crypt', 'Frostmere Crypt is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located south-southwest of Dawnstar and east-northeast of Stonehills in The Pale. The crypt is occupied by bandits.', '''bandit'':32B ''crypt'':2A,4B,28B ''dawnstar'':17B ''east'':20B ''east-northeast'':19B ''frostmer'':1A,3B ''locat'':12B ''medium'':8B ''medium-s'':7B ''nordic'':10B ''northeast'':21B ''occupi'':30B ''pale'':26B ''ruin'':11B ''size'':9B ''south'':14B ''south-southwest'':13B ''southwest'':15B ''stonehil'':23B', 'pale', 'Frostmere Crypt is a medium-sized Nordic ruin located south-southwest of Dawnstar in The Pale. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, winterhold, whiterun, hjaalmarch', '', 'pale');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fahlbtharz_puzzle', 'You will see four small blue orbs set in paddle-like extensions on a metal pole. The orbs will spin around the pole when activated.
Solution: Activating the orbs on the paddles will activate the resonator. When several kinetic resonators are combined into a tonal lock, the resonators must be activated in the correct order to solve the puzzle and open the corresponding gate.', '''activ'':28B,30B,37B,54B ''around'':24B ''blue'':8B ''combin'':45B ''correct'':57B ''correspond'':66B ''extens'':15B ''fahlbtharz'':1A ''four'':6B ''gate'':67B ''kinet'':42B ''like'':14B ''lock'':49B ''metal'':18B ''must'':52B ''open'':64B ''orb'':9B,21B,32B ''order'':58B ''paddl'':13B,35B ''paddle-lik'':12B ''pole'':19B,26B ''puzzl'':2A,62B ''reson'':39B,43B,51B ''see'':5B ''set'':10B ''sever'':41B ''small'':7B ''solut'':29B ''solv'':60B ''spin'':23B ''tonal'':48B', 'puzzle', 'You have no idea what this puzzle is or how to solze it.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('briarheart_geis', 'These magical effects are offensive Destruction enchantments linked to the Forsworn and their Briarheart warriors. This effect binds life force and magical energy to a harvested briar heart and is available only on enchanted gear, amplifying the wielder;s power.', '''amplifi'':38B ''avail'':33B ''bind'':20B ''briar'':29B ''briarheart'':1A,16B ''destruct'':8B ''effect'':5B,19B ''enchant'':9B,36B ''energi'':25B ''forc'':22B ''forsworn'':13B ''gear'':37B ''gei'':2A ''harvest'':28B ''heart'':30B ''life'':21B ''link'':10B ''magic'':4B,24B ''offens'':7B ''power'':42B ''warrior'':17B ''wielder'':40B', 'mage', 'This powerful effect ties someone;s life force to a special heart, making them stronger. A mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('dawnfang', 'Dawnfang and Duskfang are a sentient Tsaesci longsword with four transformative forms: Dawnfang, Duskfang, and their superior variants. Known for their serpent-like design, pronged blade resembling a beast''s maw, and jeweled embellishments, the sword changes form at dawn and dusk, shifting between fiery and icy enchantments. The superior forms, Dawnfang Superior and Duskfang Superior, are achieved by satisfying the sword''s craving for lifeforce, with each transformation enhancing its powers to absorb health or magicka. The weapon repairs and recharges itself with each transformation, symbolizing its sinister purpose of dependency and corruption.', '''absorb'':76B ''achiev'':60B ''beast'':31B ''blade'':28B ''chang'':39B ''corrupt'':96B ''crave'':66B ''dawn'':42B ''dawnfang'':1A,2B,14B,54B ''depend'':94B ''design'':26B ''dusk'':44B ''duskfang'':4B,15B,57B ''embellish'':36B ''enchant'':50B ''enhanc'':72B ''fieri'':47B ''form'':13B,40B,53B ''four'':11B ''health'':77B ''ici'':49B ''jewel'':35B ''known'':20B ''lifeforc'':68B ''like'':25B ''longsword'':9B ''magicka'':79B ''maw'':33B ''power'':74B ''prong'':27B ''purpos'':92B ''recharg'':84B ''repair'':82B ''resembl'':29B ''satisfi'':62B ''sentient'':7B ''serpent'':24B ''serpent-lik'':23B ''shift'':45B ''sinist'':91B ''superior'':18B,52B,55B,58B ''sword'':38B,64B ''symbol'':89B ''transform'':12B,71B,88B ''tsaesci'':8B ''variant'':19B ''weapon'':81B', 'scholar', '
Dawnfang and Duskfang are sentient Tsaesci longswords that transform at dawn and dusk, shifting between fiery and icy enchantments. Their superior forms are achieved by feeding on lifeforce, enhancing their ability to absorb health or magicka, and they repair themselves with each transformation.', '', '', 'artifacts');
