INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('steel_mace', 'Steel Mace is a blunt steel weapon which deals average damage. Its visual design is straightforward and functional, with a polished silver-gray finish and minimal ornamentation focused on practicality. To craft it: 3 steel ingots, 1 iron ingot, and 1 leather strip at a blacksmith forge. An Adept smith can craft it. It can be tempered/improved by using steel at a workbench.', '''1'':40B,44B ''3'':37B ''adept'':52B ''averag'':12B ''blacksmith'':49B ''blunt'':7B ''craft'':35B,55B ''damag'':13B ''deal'':11B ''design'':16B ''finish'':27B ''focus'':31B ''forg'':50B ''function'':20B ''gray'':26B ''ingot'':39B,42B ''iron'':41B ''leather'':45B ''mace'':2A,4B ''minim'':29B ''ornament'':30B ''polish'':23B ''practic'':33B ''silver'':25B ''silver-gray'':24B ''smith'':53B ''steel'':1A,3B,8B,38B,63B ''straightforward'':18B ''strip'':46B ''tempered/improved'':60B ''use'':62B ''visual'':15B ''weapon'':9B ''workbench'':66B', 'blacksmith', 'Steel Mace is a blunt steel weapon which deals average damage. Its visual design is straightforward and functional, with a polished silver-gray finish and minimal ornamentation focused on practicality. You do not know how to craft it, but a blacksmith would.', '', '', 'equipment');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fortify_onehanded', 'These magical effects are utility-focused Restoration abilities that increase the damage dealt with one-handed weapons, such as swords, daggers, and maces. This effect is available in pre-crafted potions, can be brewed into custom potions, and can also be applied to enchanted gear, making it indispensable for duelists and rogues. Generally combining at least two of the following ingredients, provided they share this effect, will create a potion with the Fortify One-handed effect: Bear Claws, Canis Root, Hanging Moss, Rock Warbler Egg', '''abil'':11B ''also'':45B ''appli'':47B ''avail'':31B ''bear'':83B ''brew'':39B ''cani'':85B ''claw'':84B ''combin'':59B ''craft'':35B ''creat'':73B ''custom'':41B ''dagger'':25B ''damag'':15B ''dealt'':16B ''duelist'':55B ''effect'':5B,29B,71B,82B ''egg'':91B ''enchant'':49B ''focus'':9B ''follow'':65B ''fortifi'':1A,78B ''gear'':50B ''general'':58B ''hand'':20B,81B ''hang'':87B ''increas'':13B ''indispens'':53B ''ingredi'':66B ''least'':61B ''mace'':27B ''magic'':4B ''make'':51B ''moss'':88B ''one'':19B,80B ''one-hand'':18B,79B ''onehand'':2A ''potion'':36B,42B,75B ''pre'':34B ''pre-craft'':33B ''provid'':67B ''restor'':10B ''rock'':89B ''rogu'':57B ''root'':86B ''share'':69B ''sword'':24B ''two'':62B ''util'':8B ''utility-focus'':7B ''warbler'':90B ''weapon'':21B', 'alchemist, mage', 'This magic makes one-handed weapons, like swords and daggers, deal more damage. An alchemist or mage might know more though.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('hjerim', 'Hjerim is a house in Windhelm that can be purchased. Located in the Valunstrad district, its name, "Home of Frost," is derived from the ancient Nordic language. The house was once owned by Friga Shatter-Shield, the daughter of Tova Shatter-Shield. After Friga''s tragic death, the property was abandoned and later became available for purchase.', '''abandon'':54B ''ancient'':26B ''avail'':58B ''becam'':57B ''daughter'':40B ''death'':50B ''deriv'':23B ''district'':16B ''friga'':35B,47B ''frost'':21B ''hjerim'':1A,2B ''home'':19B ''hous'':5B,30B ''languag'':28B ''later'':56B ''locat'':12B ''name'':18B ''nordic'':27B ''own'':33B ''properti'':52B ''purchas'':11B,60B ''shatter'':37B,44B ''shatter-shield'':36B,43B ''shield'':38B,45B ''tova'':42B ''tragic'':49B ''valunstrad'':15B ''windhelm'':7B', 'eastmarch', 'Hjerim is a house in Windhelm that can be purchased. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
