The Axe Man, you do not know the author of the book and have limited knowledge of it, tells the story of Minas Torik, a Morag Tong assassin whose expertise with an axe stems from a traumatic and abusive childhood. Thematically, it explores how oppression and repetitive hardship can shape unexpected skills, the psychological toll of abuse, and the transformation of trauma into a tool for survival and violence.', '', '', 'lore');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('thalmor_gloves', 'Thalmor Gloves have basic protection quality. Their visual design is elegant and fitted, crafted from smooth black leather for a sophisticated look. They can not be crafted. It can be tempered/improved by using refined moonstone at a workbench.', '''basic'':6B ''black'':19B ''craft'':16B,29B ''design'':11B ''eleg'':13B ''fit'':15B ''glove'':2A,4B ''leather'':20B ''look'':24B ''moonston'':37B ''protect'':7B ''qualiti'':8B ''refin'':36B ''smooth'':18B ''sophist'':23B ''tempered/improved'':33B ''thalmor'':1A,3B ''use'':35B ''visual'':10B ''workbench'':40B', 'blacksmith', 'Thalmor Gloves have basic protection quality. Their visual design is elegant and fitted, crafted from smooth black leather for a sophisticated look. They can not be crafted. It can be tempered/improved by using refined moonstone at a workbench.', '', '', 'equipment');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('zun_haal_viik', 'Disarm is a Shout that defies steel, ripping the weapon from an opponent''s grasp. The three words of power in this Shout are Zun (Weapon), which targets the weapon of your foe; Haal (Hand), which pries it from their grip; and Viik (Defeat), which ensures their weapon is taken away in defeat.', '''away'':54B ''defeat'':47B,56B ''defi'':9B ''disarm'':4B ''ensur'':49B ''foe'':36B ''grasp'':18B ''grip'':44B ''haal'':2A,37B ''hand'':38B ''oppon'':16B ''power'':23B ''pri'':40B ''rip'':11B ''shout'':7B,26B ''steel'':10B ''taken'':53B ''target'':31B ''three'':20B ''viik'':3A,46B ''weapon'':13B,29B,33B,51B ''word'':21B ''zun'':1A,28B', 'dragon', 'This is a Dragon Shout. You do not know much about Dragon shouts, or their language.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('stoneflesh', 'Stoneflesh is an Alteration spell that enhances the caster''s armor rating for a short duration, offering improved protection. It requires an Apprentice skill level to cast.', '''alter'':5B ''apprentic'':24B ''armor'':12B ''cast'':28B ''caster'':10B ''durat'':17B ''enhanc'':8B ''improv'':19B ''level'':26B ''offer'':18B ''protect'':20B ''rate'':13B ''requir'':22B ''short'':16B ''skill'':25B ''spell'':6B ''stoneflesh'':1A,2B', 'mage', 'Stoneflesh is a spell that makes the caster’s skin as tough as stone for a short time, providing better protection from attacks. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
