INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brandy-mug_farm', 'Brandy-Mug Farm is a modest wheat farm located a short distance east of Windhelm Stables in Eastmarch. The farmhouse is a simple single-room dwelling and serves as the home of Bolfrida Brandy-Mug. The farm consists of two zones: the exterior, where wheat is cultivated, and the cozy interior of the farmhouse.', '''bolfrida'':39B ''brandi'':2A,6B,41B ''brandy-mug'':1A,5B,40B ''consist'':45B ''cozi'':57B ''cultiv'':54B ''distanc'':17B ''dwell'':32B ''east'':18B ''eastmarch'':23B ''exterior'':50B ''farm'':4A,8B,13B,44B ''farmhous'':25B,61B ''home'':37B ''interior'':58B ''locat'':14B ''modest'':11B ''mug'':3A,7B,42B ''room'':31B ''serv'':34B ''short'':16B ''simpl'':28B ''singl'':30B ''single-room'':29B ''stabl'':21B ''two'':47B ''wheat'':12B,52B ''windhelm'':20B ''zone'':48B', 'eastmarch', 'Brandy-Mug Farm is a modest wheat farm located a short distance east of Windhelm Stables in Eastmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('broken_limb_camp', 'Broken Limb Camp is a giant camp located north-northwest of Darkwater Crossing and south of Mixwater Mill in Eastmarch. The camp serves as a home for giants and their mammoths, featuring the typical large bonfires and scattered mammoth bones associated with such locations. ', '''associ'':45B ''bone'':44B ''bonfir'':40B ''broken'':1A,4B ''camp'':3A,6B,10B,26B ''cross'':17B ''darkwat'':16B ''eastmarch'':24B ''featur'':36B ''giant'':9B,32B ''home'':30B ''larg'':39B ''limb'':2A,5B ''locat'':11B,48B ''mammoth'':35B,43B ''mill'':22B ''mixwat'':21B ''north'':13B ''north-northwest'':12B ''northwest'':14B ''scatter'':42B ''serv'':27B ''south'':19B ''typic'':38B', 'eastmarch', 'Broken Limb Camp is a giant camp located north-northwest of Darkwater Crossing in Eastmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('temple_of_talos', 'The Temple of Talos in Windhelm, located just northwest of Candlehearth Hall, houses a shrine dedicated to Talos in front of a statue of the deity. The temple consists of a main room with a row of five wooden benches facing the statue. After the Empire signed the White-Gold Concordat with the Thalmor, outlawing the worship of Talos, this temple became the only formal one in Skyrim under the protection of Jarl Ulfric Stormcloak.

The temple is tended by two residents, Lortheim and Jora.', '''becam'':66B ''bench'':43B ''candlehearth'':14B ''concordat'':55B ''consist'':32B ''dedic'':19B ''deiti'':29B ''empir'':49B ''face'':44B ''five'':41B ''formal'':69B ''front'':23B ''gold'':54B ''hall'':15B ''hous'':16B ''jarl'':77B ''jora'':89B ''locat'':10B ''lortheim'':87B ''main'':35B ''northwest'':12B ''one'':70B ''outlaw'':59B ''protect'':75B ''resid'':86B ''room'':36B ''row'':39B ''shrine'':18B ''sign'':50B ''skyrim'':72B ''statu'':26B,46B ''stormcloak'':79B ''talo'':3A,7B,21B,63B ''templ'':1A,5B,31B,65B,81B ''tend'':83B ''thalmor'':58B ''two'':85B ''ulfric'':78B ''white'':53B ''white-gold'':52B ''windhelm'':9B ''wooden'':42B ''worship'':61B', 'eastmarch, priest', 'The Temple of Talos in Windhelm, located just northwest of Candlehearth Hall, houses a shrine dedicated to Talos in front of a statue of the deity.  You do not know who runs the shrine.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bonemold_helmet', 'Bonemold Helmet is a basic bonemold helmet with basic protection quality. 
Its visual design is rough and organic, with a tan, bone-like texture reinforced by dark bindings and a utilitarian shape. To craft it: 1 netch leather, 1 iron ingots, 6 bonemold at a blacksmith forge. An Apprentice smith can craft it. It can be tempered/improved by using bonemeal at a workbench.', '''1'':39B,42B ''6'':45B ''apprentic'':52B ''basic'':7B,11B ''bind'':31B ''blacksmith'':49B ''bone'':25B ''bone-lik'':24B ''bonem'':63B ''bonemold'':1A,3B,8B,46B ''craft'':37B,55B ''dark'':30B ''design'':16B ''forg'':50B ''helmet'':2A,4B,9B ''ingot'':44B ''iron'':43B ''leather'':41B ''like'':26B ''netch'':40B ''organ'':20B ''protect'':12B ''qualiti'':13B ''reinforc'':28B ''rough'':18B ''shape'':35B ''smith'':53B ''tan'':23B ''tempered/improved'':60B ''textur'':27B ''use'':62B ''utilitarian'':34B ''visual'':15B ''workbench'':66B', 'blacksmith', 'Bonemold Helmet is a basic bonemold helmet with basic protection quality. 
