Its visual design is sleek and black, with smooth, angular lines and silver accents that give it a refined yet intimidating appearance. To craft it: 3 ebony ingots and 2 leather strips at a blacksmith forge. An Expert smith can craft it. It can be tempered/improved by using ebony at a workbench.', '''2'':43B ''3'':39B ''accent'':27B ''angular'':23B ''appear'':35B ''basic'':7B ''black'':20B ''blacksmith'':48B ''craft'':37B,54B ''design'':16B ''eboni'':1A,3B,8B,40B,62B ''expert'':51B ''fantast'':11B ''forg'':49B ''give'':29B ''helmet'':2A,4B,9B ''ingot'':41B ''intimid'':34B ''leather'':44B ''line'':24B ''protect'':12B ''qualiti'':13B ''refin'':32B ''silver'':26B ''sleek'':18B ''smith'':52B ''smooth'':22B ''strip'':45B ''tempered/improved'':59B ''use'':61B ''visual'':15B ''workbench'':65B ''yet'':33B', 'blacksmith', 'Ebony Helmet is a basic ebony helmet with fantastic protection quality. 
Its visual design is sleek and black, with smooth, angular lines and silver accents that give it a refined yet intimidating appearance. You do not know how to craft it, but a blacksmith would.', '', '', 'equipment');
