INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('the_lusty_argonian_maid', 'The Lusty Argonian Maid, written by Crassius Curio, is a bawdy play featuring comedic and suggestive exchanges between the characters Lifts-Her-Tail, an Argonian maid, and Crantius Colto, her employer. The play contains two main acts that highlight the playful and risqué nature of their interactions. In Act IV, Scene III, Lifts-Her-Tail is tasked with cleaning Crantius Colto''s chambers, but their conversation soon turns flirtatious, with Crantius offering to have her polish his spear in a suggestive manner. Similarly, in Act VII, Scene II, the dialogue revolves around the preparation of a loaf of bread, with Crantius prompting Lifts-Her-Tail to "knead the loaf" in an innuendo-laden manner, furthering the humor through double entendres.

The play is known for its comedic exploration of sexual innuendo and its portrayal of an awkward yet playful relationship between the characters. Act VII, Scene II, added later in Skyrim, builds on the bawdy humor of the original, contributing to the ongoing legacy of Crassius Curio''s writing in the Elder Scrolls universe. The work explores themes of desire, subservience, and comedic misunderstandings, making it a humorous and risqué piece within the context of the series.', '''act'':42B,54B,91B,152B ''ad'':156B ''argonian'':3A,7B,30B ''around'':98B ''awkward'':145B ''bawdi'':15B,163B ''bread'':105B ''build'':160B ''chamber'':69B ''charact'':24B,151B ''clean'':65B ''colto'':34B,67B ''comed'':18B,135B,191B ''contain'':39B ''context'':202B ''contribut'':168B ''convers'':72B ''crantius'':33B,66B,77B,107B ''crassius'':11B,174B ''curio'':12B,175B ''desir'':188B ''dialogu'':96B ''doubl'':127B ''elder'':180B ''employ'':36B ''entendr'':128B ''exchang'':21B ''explor'':136B,185B ''featur'':17B ''flirtati'':75B ''further'':123B ''highlight'':44B ''humor'':125B,164B,196B ''ii'':94B,155B ''iii'':57B ''innuendo'':120B,139B ''innuendo-laden'':119B ''interact'':52B ''iv'':55B ''knead'':114B ''known'':132B ''laden'':121B ''later'':157B ''legaci'':172B ''lift'':26B,59B,110B ''lifts-her-tail'':25B,58B,109B ''loaf'':103B,116B ''lusti'':2A,6B ''maid'':4A,8B,31B ''main'':41B ''make'':193B ''manner'':88B,122B ''misunderstand'':192B ''natur'':49B ''offer'':78B ''ongo'':171B ''origin'':167B ''piec'':199B ''play'':16B,38B,46B,130B,147B ''polish'':82B ''portray'':142B ''prepar'':100B ''prompt'':108B ''relationship'':148B ''revolv'':97B ''risqué'':48B,198B ''scene'':56B,93B,154B ''scroll'':181B ''seri'':205B ''sexual'':138B ''similar'':89B ''skyrim'':159B ''soon'':73B ''spear'':84B ''subservi'':189B ''suggest'':20B,87B ''tail'':28B,61B,112B ''task'':63B ''theme'':186B ''turn'':74B ''two'':40B ''univers'':182B ''vii'':92B,153B ''within'':200B ''work'':184B ''write'':177B ''written'':9B ''yet'':146B', 'scholar', '
