You do not know the alchemical effects of this ingredient. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('sadri''s_used_wares', 'Sadri''s Used Wares is a general shop located in the Gray Quarter of Windhelm. Owned by Revyn Sadri, a Dunmer trader, the shop specializes in secondhand goods. Revyn also serves as a common trainer for Speech. ', '''also'':34B ''common'':38B ''dunmer'':25B ''general'':11B ''good'':32B ''gray'':16B ''locat'':13B ''own'':20B ''quarter'':17B ''revyn'':22B,33B ''sadri'':1A,5B,23B ''secondhand'':31B ''serv'':35B ''shop'':12B,28B ''special'':29B ''speech'':41B ''trader'':26B ''trainer'':39B ''use'':3A,7B ''ware'':4A,8B ''windhelm'':19B', 'eastmarch', 'Sadri''s Used Wares is a general shop located in the Gray Quarter of Windhelm. Owned by Revyn Sadri.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ivory_dragon_claw', 'Combination: Hawk—Hawk—Dragon', '''claw'':3A ''combin'':4B ''dragon'':2A ''hawk—hawk—dragon'':5B ''ivori'':1A', 'puzzle', 'You have no idea what the claw is or how to solze its puzzle.', '', '', 'items');
