You do not know the alchemical effects of this ingredient. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('elven_mace', 'Elven Mace is a blunt Elven weapon which deals good damage. Its visual design is elegant and golden, with smooth curves and intricate patterns that reflect refined craftsmanshipTo craft it: 1 refined moonstone, 1 quicksilver ingot, 2 iron ingots, and 1 leather strip at a blacksmith forge. An Adept smith can craft it. An Adept smith can craft it.It can be tempered/improved by using moonstone at a workbench.', '''1'':33B,36B,43B ''2'':39B ''adept'':51B,57B ''blacksmith'':48B ''blunt'':7B ''craft'':31B,54B,60B ''craftsmanshipto'':30B ''curv'':23B ''damag'':13B ''deal'':11B ''design'':16B ''eleg'':18B ''elven'':1A,3B,8B ''forg'':49B ''golden'':20B ''good'':12B ''ingot'':38B,41B ''intric'':25B ''iron'':40B ''it.it'':61B ''leather'':44B ''mace'':2A,4B ''moonston'':35B,67B ''pattern'':26B ''quicksilv'':37B ''refin'':29B,34B ''reflect'':28B ''smith'':52B,58B ''smooth'':22B ''strip'':45B ''tempered/improved'':64B ''use'':66B ''visual'':15B ''weapon'':9B ''workbench'':70B', 'blacksmith', 'Elven Mace is a blunt Elven weapon which deals good damage. Its visual design is elegant and golden, with smooth curves and intricate patterns that reflect refined craftsmanship You do not know how to craft it, but a blacksmith would.', '', '', 'equipment');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('new_gnisis_cornerclub', 'New Gnisis Cornerclub is a tavern located in Windhelm''s Gray Quarter, situated next to Sadri''s Used Wares. The tavern is owned and operated by Ambarys Rendar, who tends the counter, with the help of his employee Malthyr Elenil, who is responsible for cleaning the taproom.', '''ambari'':30B ''clean'':48B ''cornerclub'':3A,6B ''counter'':35B ''elenil'':43B ''employe'':41B ''gnisi'':2A,5B ''gray'':14B ''help'':38B ''locat'':10B ''malthyr'':42B ''new'':1A,4B ''next'':17B ''oper'':28B ''own'':26B ''quarter'':15B ''rendar'':31B ''respons'':46B ''sadri'':19B ''situat'':16B ''taproom'':50B ''tavern'':9B,24B ''tend'':33B ''use'':21B ''ware'':22B ''windhelm'':12B', 'eastmarch', 'New Gnisis Cornerclub is a tavern located in Windhelm''s Gray Quarter. You do not know who owns it.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, pale, rift, winterhold, whiterun', '', 'eastmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('castle_volkihar', 'Castle Volkihar is a large, ominous castle located on an island far northwest of Solitude, connected to Volkihar Keep. It serves as the base of operations for the Volkihar Vampire Clan. To reach Castle Volkihar, you can hire a rowboat at Dawnstar or Icewater Jetty.', '''base'':26B ''castl'':1A,3B,9B,36B ''clan'':33B ''connect'':18B ''dawnstar'':44B ''far'':14B ''hire'':40B ''icewat'':46B ''island'':13B ''jetti'':47B ''keep'':21B ''larg'':7B ''locat'':10B ''northwest'':15B ''omin'':8B ''oper'':28B ''reach'':35B ''rowboat'':42B ''serv'':23B ''solitud'':17B ''vampir'':32B ''volkihar'':2A,4B,20B,31B,37B', 'haafingar, volkihar, dawnguard, vampire', 'Castle Volkihar is a large, ominous castle located on an island far northwest of Solitude, connected to Volkihar Keep. Rumors of a powerful vampire clan lives here.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, reach, hjaalmarch', '', 'haafingar');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('holy_water', 'Holy Water is referenced in tales and songs, often as a joke or a mythical substance associated with divine protection.', '''associ'':19B ''divin'':21B ''holi'':1A,3B ''joke'':14B ''mythic'':17B ''often'':11B ''protect'':22B ''referenc'':6B ''song'':10B ''substanc'':18B ''tale'':8B ''water'':2A,4B', 'sanguine', 'You know nothing about this and suspect it may be an invention of a bard’s tale.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('fire_storm', 'Fire Storm is a Destruction spell that creates a massive explosion of fire, causing intense fire damage over a wide area. It requires a Master skill level to cast.', '''area'':23B ''cast'':31B ''caus'':16B ''creat'':10B ''damag'':19B ''destruct'':7B ''explos'':13B ''fire'':1A,3B,15B,18B ''intens'':17B ''level'':29B ''massiv'':12B ''master'':27B ''requir'':25B ''skill'':28B ''spell'':8B ''storm'':2A,4B ''wide'':22B', 'mage', 'Fire Storm is a spell that creates a massive explosion of fire, dealing intense fire damage over a large area. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('mzinchaleft', 'Mzinchaleft is a medium-sized Dwarven ruin located southwest of Dawnstar and north of Frostmere Crypt in Hjaalmarch.', '''crypt'':18B ''dawnstar'':13B ''dwarven'':8B ''frostmer'':17B ''hjaalmarch'':20B ''locat'':10B ''medium'':6B ''medium-s'':5B ''mzinchaleft'':1A,2B ''north'':15B ''ruin'':9B ''size'':7B ''southwest'':11B', 'hjaalmarch, dwemer', 'Mzinchaleft is a medium-sized Dwarven ruin located southwest of Dawnstar and north of Frostmere Crypt in Hjaalmarch.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, pale, haafingar', '', 'hjaalmarch');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('greenspring_hollow', 'Greenspring Hollow is a shallow outdoor cave nestled west-northwest of Whiterun and southwest of Hamvir''s Rest, situated amidst the rolling plains of Whiterun Hold. ', '''amidst'':23B ''cave'':9B ''greenspr'':1A,3B ''hamvir'':19B ''hold'':29B ''hollow'':2A,4B ''nestl'':10B ''northwest'':13B ''outdoor'':8B ''plain'':26B ''rest'':21B ''roll'':25B ''shallow'':7B ''situat'':22B ''southwest'':17B ''west'':12B ''west-northwest'':11B ''whiterun'':15B,28B', 'whiterun', 'Greenspring Hollow is a shallow outdoor cave nestled west-northwest of Whiterun.You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, eastmarch, reach, pale, hjaalmarch', '', 'whiterun');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('call_to_arms', 'Call to Arms is an Illusion spell that boosts the combat abilities of nearby allies, increasing their stamina, health, and attack power for a short period. It requires an Adept skill level to cast.', '''abil'':15B ''adept'':33B ''alli'':18B ''arm'':3A,6B ''attack'':24B ''boost'':12B ''call'':1A,4B ''cast'':37B ''combat'':14B ''health'':22B ''illus'':9B ''increas'':19B ''level'':35B ''nearbi'':17B ''period'':29B ''power'':25B ''requir'':31B ''short'':28B ''skill'':34B ''spell'':10B ''stamina'':21B', 'mage', 'Call to Arms is a spell that boosts the combat abilities of nearby allies, increasing their stamina, health, and attack power for a short period. You do not know much else about this spell.', '', '', 'spells');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('aversion_to_frost', 'Exposing a target’s vulnerability to frost, this poison increases the damage they take from frost attacks. Higher tiers amplify the effect. These poisons can be found in random loot, purchased from apothecaries, or crafted using alchemy. Tiers: weak, standard, potent, virulent, deadly.', '''alchemi'':39B ''amplifi'':22B ''apothecari'':35B ''attack'':19B ''avers'':1A ''craft'':37B ''damag'':14B ''dead'':45B ''effect'':24B ''expos'':4B ''found'':29B ''frost'':3A,9B,18B ''higher'':20B ''increas'':12B ''loot'':32B ''poison'':11B,26B ''potent'':43B ''purchas'':33B ''random'':31B ''standard'':42B ''take'':16B ''target’'':6B ''tier'':21B,40B ''use'':38B ''virul'':44B ''vulner'':7B ''weak'':41B', 'alchemist, mage, scholar, witch, psijic, collegeofwinterhold', 'This poison increases a target''s vulnerability to frost. You do not know the full effects or details of this poison. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('blizzard_rest', 'Blizzard Rest is a giant camp located south of Dawnstar and north-northeast of Loreius Farm in The Pale. The camp is inhabited by giants and features the usual assortment of items associated with their camps, including mammoth bones and cooking fires,.', '''associ'':36B ''assort'':33B ''blizzard'':1A,3B ''bone'':42B ''camp'':8B,24B,39B ''cook'':44B ''dawnstar'':12B ''farm'':19B ''featur'':30B ''fire'':45B ''giant'':7B,28B ''includ'':40B ''inhabit'':26B ''item'':35B ''locat'':9B ''loreius'':18B ''mammoth'':41B ''north'':15B ''north-northeast'':14B ''northeast'':16B ''pale'':22B ''rest'':2A,4B ''south'':10B ''usual'':32B', 'pale', 'Blizzard Rest is a giant camp located south of Dawnstar in The Pale. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, winterhold, whiterun, hjaalmarch', '', 'pale');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('bliss_bug_thorax', 'Bliss Bug Thorax is an ingredient harvested by catching Bliss Bugs. Alchemy effects: Weakness to Fire, Resist Fire, Fortify Heavy Armor, and Fortify Illusion.', '''alchemi'':15B ''armor'':24B ''bliss'':1A,4B,13B ''bug'':2A,5B,14B ''catch'':12B ''effect'':16B ''fire'':19B,21B ''fortifi'':22B,26B ''harvest'':10B ''heavi'':23B ''illus'':27B ''ingredi'':9B ''resist'':20B ''thorax'':3A,6B ''weak'':17B', 'alchemist', 'Bliss Bug Thorax is an ingredient harvested by catching Bliss Bugs. 
You do not know the alchemical effects of this ingredient. However, an alchemist might.', '', '', 'items');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('brittleshin_pass', 'Brittleshin Pass is a small mountain passage connecting Whiterun Hold and Falkreath Hold, located southwest of Whiterun and west of Bleak Falls Barrow. ', '''barrow'':25B ''bleak'':23B ''brittleshin'':1A,3B ''connect'':10B ''falkreath'':14B ''fall'':24B ''hold'':12B,15B ''locat'':16B ''mountain'':8B ''pass'':2A,4B ''passag'':9B ''small'':7B ''southwest'':17B ''west'':21B ''whiterun'':11B,19B', 'falkreath', 'Brittleshin Pass is a small mountain passage connecting Whiterun Hold and Falkreath Hold, located southwest of Whiterun and west of Bleak Falls Barrow. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, whiterun, rift reach', '', 'falkreath');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('reach_stormcloak_camp', 'The Reach Stormcloak Camp is a military encampment located west of Liar''s Retreat and northeast of Karthwasten in the Reach. It serves as a base for the Stormcloak forces during Skyrim''s civil war and is commanded by Kottir Red-Shoal.', '''base'':29B ''camp'':3A,7B ''civil'':37B ''command'':41B ''encamp'':11B ''forc'':33B ''karthwasten'':21B ''kottir'':43B ''liar'':15B ''locat'':12B ''militari'':10B ''northeast'':19B ''reach'':1A,5B,24B ''red'':45B ''red-shoal'':44B ''retreat'':17B ''serv'':26B ''shoal'':46B ''skyrim'':35B ''stormcloak'':2A,6B,32B ''war'':38B ''west'':13B', 'reach, stormcloak', 'The Reach Stormcloak Camp is a military encampment located northeast of Karthwasten in the Reach. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, falkreath, whiterun, hjaalmarch, haafingar', '', 'reach');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('ring_of_hircine', 'The Ring of Hircine is a powerful Daedric artifact created by Hircine, the Daedric Prince of the Hunt. Typically depicted as an engraved ring adorned with the image of a wolf''s head, the ring grants control over the wearer''s lycanthropy, allowing them to transform into a werewolf at will, bypassing the usual restrictions of the moon and bloodlust. For non-lycanthropes, the ring''s effects are usually dormant, though it has been known to extend life or induce werewolf transformations. However, Hircine can curse the ring, causing unpredictable transformations for those who have not earned it.', '''adorn'':28B ''allow'':46B ''artifact'':12B ''bloodlust'':63B ''bypass'':55B ''caus'':93B ''control'':40B ''creat'':13B ''curs'':90B ''daedric'':11B,17B ''depict'':23B ''dormant'':74B ''earn'':101B ''effect'':71B ''engrav'':26B ''extend'':81B ''grant'':39B ''head'':36B ''hircin'':3A,7B,15B,88B ''howev'':87B ''hunt'':21B ''imag'':31B ''induc'':84B ''known'':79B ''life'':82B ''lycanthrop'':67B ''lycanthropi'':45B ''moon'':61B ''non'':66B ''non-lycanthrop'':65B ''power'':10B ''princ'':18B ''restrict'':58B ''ring'':1A,5B,27B,38B,69B,92B ''though'':75B ''transform'':49B,86B,95B ''typic'':22B ''unpredict'':94B ''usual'':57B,73B ''wearer'':43B ''werewolf'':52B,85B ''wolf'':34B', 'daedric, daedra, scholar, werewolf, hunter', 'The Ring of Hircine is a Daedric artifact created by Hircine, the Daedric Prince of the Hunt. Itis rumoured to allow the wearer to transform into a werewolf.', '', '', 'artifacts');
INSERT INTO public.oghma VALUES ('yorgrim_overlook', 'Yorgrim Overlook (also referred to as Yorgrim''s Overlook) is a small outdoor Nordic ruin located on the southern slope of the mountain range directly south of Winterhold. The path to the overlook begins just northeast of Forsaken Cave, leading up a series of steps flanked by ancient Nordic statues.', '''also'':5B ''ancient'':50B ''begin'':36B ''cave'':41B ''direct'':27B ''flank'':48B ''forsaken'':40B ''lead'':42B ''locat'':18B ''mountain'':25B ''nordic'':16B,51B ''northeast'':38B ''outdoor'':15B ''overlook'':2A,4B,11B,35B ''path'':32B ''rang'':26B ''refer'':6B ''ruin'':17B ''seri'':45B ''slope'':22B ''small'':14B ''south'':28B ''southern'':21B ''statu'':52B ''step'':47B ''winterhold'':30B ''yorgrim'':1A,3B,9B', 'pale', 'Yorgrim Overlook is a small outdoor Nordic ruin located on the southern slope of the mountain range directly south of Winterhold. You do not know anything else about this area.', 'skyrimall, eastmarch, winterhold, whiterun, hjaalmarch', '', 'pale');
